  {"op": "wait", "s": 1.0, "phase": "look", "for": "gorge_forest_7_play_*"},

  {"op": "index", "title": "P5-4 judgment set: Gorge", "intro": "Produced by tools/render_jobs/jobs/phase5_gorge.json at 1920x1080. New 150 ft Gorge maps through the driver's new_map op, saved as _p5j_gorge_<biome>_<seed>: temperate forest seeds 7 (two tiers, a stream, an arch), 3 (two tiers, a stream, no arch) and 1 (one tier, two bends, a dry wash), and rocky badlands seed 7. Per level: home with the grid, home with the water hidden, zoom 8 on the stage and on the arch, the stream or the floor; then seed 7 played with tokens. The recipe's report per level is in log.txt."}
 ]
